      "message": "fix(motion): a step too small to ladder is refused by name, never allocated\n\nband() and cut_levels() check the pass count before allocating: a\nstepover or stepdown needing more than MAX_PASSES (100000) rows or\nlevels, or too small to advance the coordinate, is refused as\nGenError::Invalid naming the parameter. A 1e-9 mm Face stepover or\nContour stepdown aborted the process on a ~96 GB allocation.\n\nFixes #691\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
